<title>SWITZERLAND: Fotolabo 1996 net drops 23 percent.</title>
<headline>Fotolabo 1996 net drops 23 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MONTPREVEYRES, Switzerland 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			20.5		down 23 pct</p>
<p> Div (share)		    9		   vs 9</p>
<p> Turnover			 306.8	     up 54 pct</p>
<p> Ordinary operating profit  39.9		up 33 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Fotolabo SA said said it took 4.5 million francs in restructuring charges. EBITDA before changes in net working capital rose 53 percent to 63.1 million. The drop in net profit reflected losses in photo booth activities and higher taxes.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
